{"message":"Based on the current offers I found, the best active sign-up promotion is the EcoCard: earn 2,000 sustainability points after spending $5,000 in eligible purchases during your first month. The offer runs through December 15, 2025, and the points are worth $20 at the standard $0.01-per-point redemption value. The card has a $50 annual fee and a 19.99% APR on carried balances.

For comparison, the previously advertised $500 Silver Rewards Card statement-credit offer required opening the account by June 30, 2025, so it is no longer available. I did not find a current personal-card offer with a larger active cash-back sign-up bonus.

If you’re applying for a business card, the Business Bronze Rewards Card advertises a $500 statement credit after $10,000 in spending within two months, but the offer’s active dates were not specified in the information available to me."}
